OneIsland_KindleRoad_StormDen_Text_Acolyte1Intro::
    .string "Another seeker of the beast?\n"
    .string "The STORM does not like visitors.$"

OneIsland_KindleRoad_StormDen_Text_Acolyte1Defeat::
    .string "Your storm is stronger...$"

OneIsland_KindleRoad_StormDen_Text_Acolyte1Post::
    .string "The beast sleeps at the end of\n"
    .string "the cave. Many guard its sleep.$"

OneIsland_KindleRoad_StormDen_Text_Acolyte2Intro::
    .string "We keep the thunder company.\n"
    .string "You are only noise.$"

OneIsland_KindleRoad_StormDen_Text_Acolyte2Defeat::
    .string "Quiet at last.$"

OneIsland_KindleRoad_StormDen_Text_Acolyte2Post::
    .string "Follow the humming. It grows.$"

OneIsland_KindleRoad_StormDen_Text_Acolyte3Intro::
    .string "The beast gave us light when the\n"
    .string "world went dark. We repay it.$"

OneIsland_KindleRoad_StormDen_Text_Acolyte3Defeat::
    .string "The light forgives you.$"

OneIsland_KindleRoad_StormDen_Text_Acolyte3Post::
    .string "Only the ORACLE can open the\n"
    .string "last gate.$"

OneIsland_KindleRoad_StormDen_Text_Acolyte4Intro::
    .string "Turn back, runner! This cave is\n"
    .string "a temple, not a playground!$"

OneIsland_KindleRoad_StormDen_Text_Acolyte4Defeat::
    .string "The temple is quiet again.$"

OneIsland_KindleRoad_StormDen_Text_Acolyte4Post::
    .string "The ORACLE heard you coming.$"

OneIsland_KindleRoad_StormDen_Text_OracleIntro::
    .string "I am the ORACLE of the STORM.\n"
    .string "Since the ECHO opened, the beast\p"
    .string "has slept in our hall, and we\n"
    .string "have kept it safe.$"

OneIsland_KindleRoad_StormDen_Text_OracleDefeat::
    .string "...Then the storm has chosen you.$"

OneIsland_KindleRoad_StormDen_Text_OraclePost::
    .string "Go. But treat it as the storm\n"
    .string "treats us: with respect.$"

OneIsland_KindleRoad_StormDen_Text_GuardsLeft::
    .string "The beast does not stir.\n"
    .string "Its guardians still stand watch.$"
